      <p><seg source="#source-649-733">御別申候より急ニ兵庫ニ下り、同二日の夕七ツ過ギ、土佐の国</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-742-796"><seg source="#source-733-742">すさキ</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-769-781">（須崎）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-796-808">と申港に</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-811-856"><seg source="#source-808-811">付</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-832-841">（着）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-856-868">居申候。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-868-928"><rb><seg source="#source-868-871">先</seg><g ref="#gaiji-1-2-22" source="#source-871-904">〻</g></rb><rt>（まづまづ）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-928-1027">ぶじ御よろこび。是より近日長崎へ出申候て、又急々上京仕候。御まち可</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1027-1039">レ</note><seg source="#source-1039-1042">被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1042-1054">レ</note><seg source="#source-1054-1077">遣候。かしこ。</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1077-1112" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p><seg source="#source-1098-1112">八月五日</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1112-1180" style="padding-inline-start: 3em">
        <p><seg source="#source-1133-1148">おとせさま</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-1148-1180" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(0)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=0"><seg source="#source-1166-1180">うめより</seg></seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1180-1210" style="padding-inline-start: 7em">
        <p><seg source="#source-1201-1210">御本え</seg></p>
      </div>
    </body>
